  },
  {
   "id": "59e3e863-c5e9-49db-afcd-de15cd5a382b",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The project now treats the following as three distinct layers:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "187a0e18-0246-4cd7-a8a0-5961e59a903e",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Primary Supplier Research Prompt — the operational research engine for Supplier Intelligence."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "bff48d02-b2c0-450f-8354-0385462a1410",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Claude Handoff Prompt — the coordination/review/development layer used to direct Claude work on the project and its Prompt."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "31e92015-4b7e-4fac-9272-c1519b5daeba",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "EXECUTION-PROMPT COMPILER — student services — a separate generic Prompt Compiler reference. It is not part of the Supplier Intelligence engine and must not be inserted into it automatically."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0c4575c8-99ee-4231-893e-b53e19385c4a",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Historical Handoff Rule"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c00d1cb5-084c-41a0-af99-c0d333dcbd24",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The older Claude handoff remains a historical reference. Reuse is permitted only after reconciliation with the current project state, the Primary Reference Pair, v4.1 Candidate, and recorded governance decisions."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9c8f4c1d-8dd4-41b1-aec0-1da132276c00",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Non-Mixing Rule"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c23baf33-3c1e-4179-a460-b3e83699f733",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not silently merge these layers, transfer unrelated modules, or import unrelated project material into Supplier Intelligence. Any proposed structural or governance change remains subject to the existing authority and approval rules."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6f2ac59b-9629-4a9b-aec7-93b74563ad72",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "This section records the user's explicit approval and does not promote any Prompt Candidate to Canonical status."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T18:42:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6cfe1ccd-3b14-401b-b803-b4f605366814",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "✅ Approved Scope Clarification — Products + Services"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "698c04cf-54d8-4331-89ba-01562a9bedd1",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Decision ID: Scope-Product-Service-Coverage-1.0"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "28f2164b-d5ca-4d3f-8cad-5b165717f2f8",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "تم تثبيت أن منظومة Adaptive Supplier Intelligence Research Engine تبحث في المنتجات والخدمات الرقمية معًا. العائلات الحالية المسجلة للمشروع: AI/SaaS، Gift Cards، Game Top-up، Game Keys، Software/Licenses، eSIM/Telecom، SMM، Virtual Numbers/SMS، Digital Subscriptions، وخدمات رقمية قائمة على API عندما تنطبق، إضافة إلى فئات رقمية أخرى مرتبطة بالنطاق."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2be36b63-0b15-46da-a3e6-659e1e02b3ab",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Invariant: Product/Service Family ≠ Actual SKU."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d856ed4d-6481-47b2-99df-2743471cf6ac",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "الفئات تحدد نطاق المحرك، لكن كل Run يحتاج SKU فعليًا قابلًا للتحديد قبل المقارنة السعرية. لا تُشتق قيمة SKU من أمثلة واجهة z.ai، ولا تُحوّل الملاحظات التشغيلية الجديدة إلى قاعدة Prompt دون مراجعة."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T20:47:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d773eaa2-f93d-409c-b8b5-d3b8f7a8d1d0",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
