  },
  {
   "id": "a8c68784-f0ba-4648-bcdd-221c9f6979b1",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Claude reported creation of v4.2 Candidate, parent v4.1, adding catalog-scale controls: Catalog/Batch objects, Catalog Coverage Ledger, cross-batch Entity persistence, SKU-level lifecycle states, cumulative cross-batch budget rollup, and explicit Global Discovery + Region-Aware SKU Matching wording."
