   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Verified at artifact level: Catalog Program/Batch architecture, Catalog Coverage Ledger, SKU lifecycle states, cross-batch Entity Resolution persistence, catalog budget rollup, and explicit separation of global supplier discovery from region-aware SKU matching are present in the file."
